// The caret, drawn.
//
// It sits with the caret rather than with the rest of the renderer for two
// reasons: what it draws is keyboard state rather than document content, and
// every directory under app/view/draw already holds its three entries.

ed_bar() {
  int k = ed_car();
  int n = len((import lay_g));
  ed_bar2(k, n);
} return void;
